WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.900
Reports never answer the exact thing you wanted.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:11.900
So ask.

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.900
What would I pay for forty orders a month?

4
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.900
It works it out from what it already read.

5
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.900
The pages are read once. Answers come back in seconds, not minutes.

6
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.900
Now something it cannot know.

7
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.900
It says the pages do not cover that.

8
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:43.900
And offers to go and look, rather than inventing something plausible.

9
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:49.800
A tool that says I do not know is one you can trust when it answers.

10
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.800
Watching for changes is next.
